==============================================================================
O22 — weighted beat  (three variants, same primes, same grid, NO FITTING)
==============================================================================
  V0_plain         sum_p p^(-1/2) sin(t log p)
  V1_logp          sum_p (log p) p^(-1/2) sin(t log p)
  V2_vonmangoldt   sum_{p,m<=mmax} (log p) p^(-m/2) sin(t m log p) = sum_n Lambda(n) n^(-1/2) sin(t log n)

  The Beat is the m = 1 term of Connes' Weil local term with the (log p) weight
  dropped and the prime powers dropped. This script restores them, one at a time.

  t grid : [10, 50] step 0.0001  (400001 points)
  mmax   : 20   term floor : 1e-15
  refine : golden section to bracket width 1e-12

